# React / Next.js performance

When writing, reviewing, or refactoring React or Next.js UI/data code, load and follow
`.cursor/skills/vercel-react-best-practices/SKILL.md` (and relevant files under its `rules/`).

Prioritize by impact: waterfalls → bundle size → server → client fetch → re-renders → rendering → JS → advanced.

When this is a **Next.js** app (dependency `next` present), prefer MCP `next-devtools` for live runtime work: start `npm run dev` (Next 16+), then `nextjs_index` → `nextjs_call` / `nextjs_docs` before guessing at errors, routes, or docs.
